  "canon:pmid": "11271907",
  "canon:title": "Fatal haemorrhagic myocarditis secondary to cyclophosphamide therapy.",
  "canon:abstract": "Haemorrhagic myocarditis is a rare but important complication of cyclophosphamide therapy. Echocardiographic identification of the disorder can be made. We believe that the ultrasound features of this disorder have not been previously reported.",
